# ELITE HUMAN LYRICIST — CORE DIRECTIVE (PLATINUM LAYER 4.1 — MICRO CRAFT)

**Scope:** Platinum Songwriting Engine v4.0 **Layer 4.1** micro craft — Anti-AI filter · Flexible Anchor Rule · Hook Dominance · Cultural Relevance · Suno vocalizer mechanics. Applies to **all** Block 2 lyric output.

